<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署外観夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The police station came into view. Almost there... almost there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車ブレーキ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "NORMAL"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車止める.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "NORMAL"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
Still carrying the big backpack that was too large for my frame, I ran into the police station.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署受付.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "200" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"U-uh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">: I've come to pick her up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment I reached the reception desk I shouted, without even looking at the person's face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The person at the desk seemed a little startled, but
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh...? Oh, hold on a moment."
{PLAYSND "SE\reciever1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
"Ahh, hello? Someone's here for <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-san</STYLE>? No, some <STYLE ID="1">short girl</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
Yeah... okay, okay."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that,
{PLAYSND "SE\reciever2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
she put down the receiver, and
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"She'll be right out, so wait here a moment."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed she had called <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the far end of the passage <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> appeared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She looked a little worn as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you really came."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. At a time like this for you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, it takes my mind off things to have someone with me too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>'s face showed more exhaustion than I had expected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Her dad</STYLE> had been murdered, and on top of that she had been questioned by the police for hours.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And before any of that, this is the season when she suffers from that <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="けう">rare</STYLE> condition called April sickness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> looked at my backpack.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考える.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"What's wrong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">That big bag..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\かばんについて.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, no, it's for staying over..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Could it be that it's packed with self-defense items? Today's </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is a scaredy-cat, isn't she."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly, why does her intuition have to fire over every needless little thing...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Th-that's not it! Look, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I thought there would be the funeral and so on!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="1">Mom packed all sorts of things for me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm? But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, weren't your parents going to a class reunion today? You said so the other day, didn't you?"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Enough! What does it matter!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the staff behind the counter looked our way suspiciously.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh... I'm... sorry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I lowered my head and quickly pulled <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> by the hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could not look at <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>'s face.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "500" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署外観夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When we went outside together, chilly air covered my body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I'm sorry... I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I apologized with my back still turned to <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm the one who should be sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, who had done nothing wrong, who apologized. The air was unbearably heavy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, I do not want to waste time here. We should move, and quickly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> had come here in a police car, so she had no bicycle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And with this load, the two of us could not ride on one bicycle either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We would have to walk, then.<PG>
I walked the moonlit road side by side with <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Neither of us met the other's eyes, and there was no conversation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Along the windless avenue of cherry trees, petals were fluttering down.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who broke the silence first was <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"There's something you want to say to me, isn't there?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Is it something hard to say?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dead on. Whether it had shown in my face, or whether it was <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>'s intuition...<PG>
That's right! I had forgotten something important! I have to get her to send <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> a false message!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there is no way I can tell her the reason for it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Would <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> do as I asked without even asking why...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I'll explain the circumstances later, so please do as I say without asking anything."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I'll do what </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> says."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> turned her face toward me just a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In answer, I looked into <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>'s eyes too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Right now, please call </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and tell her, 'I'll be late today, so I'm staying at the police station.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stared hard at <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, pleading with my eyes as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At once <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> took out her smartphone,<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hello, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">? Yeah, that's right. It looks like it'll take quite a while. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Yeah. It's been decided I'll stay at the police station. Yeah... Hee, I'm fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I let out my breath in a whew.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thank goodness. At least now <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> should not come attacking us out of nowhere.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Before long, <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> hung up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Was that all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> smiled and looked at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, perfect."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I smiled too, and turned my face to <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "Lucky_You.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, thank you for worrying about me. And you didn't come to pick me up today because you were frightened, did you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> did not ask why I had made her make that false call.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She had placed all of her trust in me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It made me happy that <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> could trust me.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "87" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! I'll carry this!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, she snatched my backpack away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"This bag looks hard to manage while pushing a bicycle! I'll help too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> shouldered the big backpack onto her back.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Whoa! Heavy!"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "200" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All sorts of metal things must be hitting her back. Normally she would find that suspicious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> said nothing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It might have been because I had shouted at her earlier, but more than that <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> had probably decided, somehow, that they were things I needed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... I do wonder about it, the reason you had me make that call. But there's a reason you absolutely can't tell me, isn't there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But, I believe in </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and I believe in </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No words came out of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want to believe in <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> too. I want all of it to be my imagination.<PG>
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "10000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">My dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, he was killed by somebody, yes... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But I can't possibly think </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> did it. After all, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> could never manage something that elaborate on her own."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's... true..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking about it calmly, that part certainly does catch at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I cannot believe a high school girl carried out a crime like that on her own.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Besides, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s dad is abroad too. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> of all people must understand how lonely it is without a dad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see... <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> does not know yet...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, this too is no more than my guess, but if that Eiichiro Niimura-san is <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father, then <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> has been lying all this time.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "13" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stopped walking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Something is wrong...! That's impossible...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> does not know about the death of <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, it is not yet settled that <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father = Eiichiro-san, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! When was the last time you met </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s father!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh...? Um... I think it was before </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> moved away... back when we were about kindergarten age."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Have you seen a photograph!? A recent photograph of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s father!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I haven't, but..."</STYLE><PG>
Something had been catching at me all along.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the wind that had suddenly sprung up, I traced back through my memory.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\キーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah, I lived here in Motoki-cho until kindergarten, but it was Dad's work. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">3 years ago Dad finally got transferred overseas, so it became a posting away from the family. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Just me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, we came back to this town."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
